{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BOMB今日発売です！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出していただけて\nありがたいですけどね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この企画は中田に向いてないんじゃないかって\n思ってしまった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"正直、この取材中\nずっと赤面してたと思うんだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人の話を聞くのは好きなんだけど\nこの話題に関しては\n自分はどう思うとか考えるの\n恥ずかしくなっちゃう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず\n読んでみてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでからのお楽しみ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/09/0473296/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/09/0473296/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前言ってた\nユニットについてのお話ですけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず\n今日、おに魂で解禁した"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『欲望のリインカーネーション』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダー1期生でやりたいなー\nって言ってたんだよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は参加してないんだけど\nアンダーライブ4th seasonの\n『ボーダー』メンバーを見たときに思った！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃー、ちーちゃん、ひめたん、らりん、愛未"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか強い！\n歌もダンスも強い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた方はわかると思うんだけど\nめっちゃかっこよくて\nかなり見応えあったと思うんだ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから\n今回できて嬉しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全Typeに収録されますいぇーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『口約束』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏、玲香、若月、中田の4人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わかりますよね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう！女子校組！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲の良さから楽曲をもらえるパターンって\n乃木坂じゃ、初めてかな？\nありがたいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/09/0473296/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏が全握のMCで言ってたけど\nそれぞれソロパートあるよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Type-Dに収録されてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はまだ中田も聴いてないので\nどきどき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/05/09/0473296/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやー\nユニット嬉しいわ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかち、他の星、乃木團、サンエト\nなど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田が入ると\nなんだかんだでバランスとれて\n人気ユニットになる\nみたいなジンクスが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...無いか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自惚れました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんね黙る。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもせっかく楽曲をいただけたんだもん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいユニットにしたいな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}